-O-methyltransferase polymorphism is associated with increased uterine leiomyoma risk in different ethnic groups</article-title><source>Journal of the Society for Gynecologic Investigation</source><year>2006</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>136</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16443508</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>